<Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="1">
<Text>INT. COFFEE SHOP - MORNING</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Action">
<Text>The room hums with morning chatter.</Text>
<ScriptNote Type="General" Color="#000000" ID="1"><Text>Check the shop name with production.</Text></ScriptNote>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Character">
<Text>MIRA</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
<Text>(over the noise)</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
<Text>One espresso, please.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Cast List">
<Text>MIRA, BARISTA</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Transition">
<Text>CUT TO:</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Shot">
<Text>CLOSE ON THE ESPRESSO MACHINE</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="2">
<Text>EXT. STREET - CONTINUOUS</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Action">
<Text>Mira steps into the rain &amp; opens her umbrella.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="General">
<Text>Outline note: keep the scene under a page.</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
<Text>Raindrops keep falling...</Text>
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="New Act">
<Text>ACT TWO</Text>
</Paragraph>
</Content>
